Calculation.

843
00:26:46,791 --> 00:26:48,000
The same calculation

844
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,958
I'd seen in Lucian
a hundred times.

845
00:26:49,958 --> 00:26:51,000
He cleared his throat.

846
00:26:53,125 --> 00:26:54,000
Vivienne,

847
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:56,791
this is an embarrassing
situation for everyone.

848
00:26:56,791 --> 00:26:58,000
Let's handle it quietly.

849
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:59,200
He glanced at his wife.

850
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:00,166
You were never here.

851
00:27:00,166 --> 00:27:02,000
Lucian and Morgana are
properly mated now.

852
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:03,200
We acknowledge
it internally

853
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,000
and move forward.

854
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:06,000
He tried for a
reasonable smile.

855
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:08,000
No reason this has
to leave these walls.

856
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,374
I stared at him.

857
00:27:11,583 --> 00:27:13,600
Luna Valeris recovered fast.

858
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:14,600
Too fast.

859
00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:15,333
Yes,

860
00:27:16,374 --> 00:27:18,583
Vivienne, you're
a sensible girl.

861
00:27:18,800 --> 00:27:20,958
You understand how
these things work.

862
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:23,000
A little discretion now

863
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:25,000
saves everyone a
great deal of trouble.

864
00:27:25,125 --> 00:27:26,541
I looked at the two of them.

865
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,333
Then at Lucian.

866
00:27:29,200 --> 00:27:31,541
Three generations
of the same thing.

867
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,333
Smiling faces

868
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,749
Reasonable voices.

869
00:27:35,400 --> 00:27:36,000
And underneath,

870
00:27:36,125 --> 00:27:38,600
the absolute certainty
that I would comply

871
00:27:38,600 --> 00:27:39,800
because it was easier

872
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,374
I had complied once.

873
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:44,125
I knew exactly
how that ended.

874
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,958
Call Chief Elder Laurent,

875
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:49,374
I'll wait.

876
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,333
They didn't call Laurent.

877
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:55,125
Instead

878
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:57,000
Alpha Valeris told the
guards to keep me

879
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,000
in the east guest room

880
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,500
until he and Lucian returned

881
00:27:59,500 --> 00:28:01,500
from what he called
a necessary visit.

882
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:05,000
I knew where
they were going.

883
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,541
I sat on the edge of the bed

884
00:28:06,600 --> 00:28:07,958
and ran through
the numbers.

885
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,333
Laurent was reasonable.

886
00:28:09,800 --> 00:28:10,958
He didn't like drama

887
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:11,958
In another life

888
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,500
he'd stayed out of it entirèly.

889
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:15,333
But this life was different.

890
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:16,500
This life

891
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:17,958
I was his daughter-in-law.

892
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:18,958
The question was

893
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,125
whether he'd
answer the door.

894
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,374
Two hours passed.

895
00:28:21,541 --> 00:28:23,166
Then Lucian
came back alone.

896
00:28:23,166 --> 00:28:23,791
Hewalked in

897
00:28:23,791 --> 00:28:25,200
and closed the
door behind him.

898
00:28:25,541 --> 00:28:27,000
He didn't look at
me right away.

899
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,166
He stood with one hand

900
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:29,166
on the door handle,

901
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:29,749
jaw tight,

902
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,500
staring at the floor.

903
00:28:31,800 --> 00:28:33,200
Laurent talked to us,

904
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:34,333
he said finally.

905
00:28:34,583 --> 00:28:35,200
And?

906
00:28:35,600 --> 00:28:36,800
He said it wasn't his place

907
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:37,541
to get involved

908
00:28:37,541 --> 00:28:39,541
in another pack's
internal matters.

909
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:40,749
Lucian looked up.

910
00:28:43,400 --> 00:28:44,400
He's not going to intrvene.

911
00:28:44,600 --> 00:28:46,374
Something cold moved
through my chest.

912
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,583
I kept my face still.

913
00:28:47,800 --> 00:28:49,125
Then you have
what you want.

914
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:49,541
I said.

915
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:50,958
Let me go home.

916
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,000
I can't.

917
00:28:52,583 --> 00:28:53,749
He crossed the room,

918
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,000
Not aggressive,

919
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,000
Almost tired.

920
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,125
My mother's right.

921
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,791
The only way to
contain this is

922
00:28:58,800 --> 00:29:00,374
if you're part of the solution.

923
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:01,374
Luna. Public face.

924
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:02,333
Everything stays clean.

925
00:29:07,800 --> 00:29:09,000
You want,me to pretend

926
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:09,800
to be your mate.

927
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:10,800
I want you to be my mate.

928
00:29:10,800 --> 00:29:12,125
He stopped in front of me.

929
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:14,749
Vivienne,

930
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:17,000
I know this isn't
how you wanted it.

931
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,500
But I can make it work

932
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:20,166
I can make it good.

933
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:21,125
You know I can.

934
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,374
I looked at him.

935
00:29:22,800 --> 00:29:24,958
He used to be able to
say things like that

936
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,400
and make me feel safe.

937
00:29:26,791 --> 00:29:28,200
Now it just made me tired.

938
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,200
No.

939
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:31,200
His expression hardened.

940
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:36,125
Then I don't have a choice.

941
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,749
I shoved him back hard.

942
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,333
He caught my wrists

943
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:43,791
and his Alpha aura hit
the room like a wave,

944
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,500
pressing down
on my inner wolf

945
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:47,200
until she went
silent and still.

946
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:48,600
I fought anyway.

947
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:50,125
I twisted and kicked,

948
00:29:50,125 --> 00:29:52,000
and refused to stop moving.

949
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,000
It didn't matter.

950
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,166
He was stronger.

951
00:29:54,166 --> 00:29:55,800
He'd always been stronger.

952
00:29:55,800 --> 00:29:56,500
Stop.

953
00:29:56,800 --> 00:29:57,333
He said.

954
00:29:57,541 --> 00:29:58,500
Not angry.

955
00:29:58,600 --> 00:29:59,749
Worse than angry.

956
00:29:59,800 --> 00:30:00,500
Resigned.

957
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,000
Like this was just something

958
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:02,958
that had to happen.

959
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,583
My back hit the mattress.

960
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:05,125
Lucian.

961
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,583
My voice came out steady

962
00:30:06,600 --> 00:30:08,166
even though
nothing else was.

963
00:30:08,800 --> 00:30:09,791
Don't do this.

964
00:30:11,583 --> 00:30:12,791
He didn't answer.

965
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:15,400
The Alpha aura
pressed harder.

966
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:18,541
My inner wolf went
completely quiet.

967
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:21,000
My arms stopped
responding.

968
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:22,500
This was it.

969
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:25,500
This was exactly how
it ended last time.

970
00:30:25,541 --> 00:30:26,500
Except last time

971
00:30:26,500 --> 00:30:28,125
there had been
no one coming.

972
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:30,400
The door exploded open.

973
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:32,500
Aria stood in the frame,

974
00:30:32,600 --> 00:30:33,500
breathing hard,

975
00:30:33,600 --> 00:30:35,583
a silver blade in both hands.

976
00:30:35,583 --> 00:30:37,374
Get your hands
off my sister.

977
00:30:39,125 --> 00:30:40,333
Lucian turned his head.

978
00:30:40,400 --> 00:30:42,000
He looked at her
the way you look-at

979
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,400
something small
and inconvenient.

980
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,541
He raisedone hand

981
00:30:44,541 --> 00:30:46,749
and release a
pulse of Alpha aura.

982
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,500
The blade flew out

983
00:30:48,600 --> 00:30:50,800
of Aria's grip and
hit the far wall.

984
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:53,125
She stumbled,

985
00:30:53,800 --> 00:30:55,500
caught herself on
the doorframe.

986
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:57,333
Lucian turned back tome.

987
00:30:57,791 --> 00:30:59,791
Aria looked at me
from across the room.

988
00:30:59,800 --> 00:31:00,791
Her hands were empty.

989
00:31:00,800 --> 00:31:01,791
Her eyes were not.

990
00:31:01,791 --> 00:31:03,541
I'm sorry, she mouthed.

991
00:31:03,541 --> 00:31:05,200
The door behind
her was still open.

992
00:31:05,374 --> 00:31:07,400
And then, I'heard
footsteps in the hall.

993
00:31:07,800 --> 00:31:09,800
Chief Elder
Laurent walked in.

994
00:31:10,791 --> 00:31:12,200
He took one look
at the room.

995
00:31:12,583 --> 00:31:13,800
At me on the bed.

996
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,200
At Aria's empty hands.

997
00:31:16,749 --> 00:31:18,541
At Lucian standing over me.

998
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:19,791
Step back.

999
00:31:19,791 --> 00:31:20,500
He said.

1000
00:31:20,500 --> 00:31:21,958
He didn't raise his voice.

1001
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,958
Lucian didn't move
immediately.

1002
00:31:26,374 --> 00:31:27,374
For one long second

1003
00:31:27,374 --> 00:31:29,000
he stayed exactly
where he was,

1004
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,958
and the room
held its breath.

1005
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,958
Then he stepped back.

1006
00:31:33,125 --> 00:31:35,200
Laurent walked to the
center of the room.

1007
00:31:35,374 --> 00:31:37,000
Behind him came
an older man.

1008
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:39,333
I recognized from High
Council ceremonies.

1009
00:31:39,400 --> 00:31:40,125
White-haired,

1010
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:40,958
unhurried.

1011
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:41,958
The Royal Seer.

1012
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:44,000
The Alpha King's
personal emissary,

1013
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:46,541
who had served the
throne for fifty years.

1014
00:31:46,791 --> 00:31:48,125
I sat up slowly.

1015
00:31:48,200 --> 00:31:49,541
Laurent looked at Lucian.

1016
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:52,200
When your father came
to me this afternoon.

1017
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:53,500
He said

1018
00:31:53,749 --> 00:31:54,600
he asked me to stay out

1019
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:56,374
of another pack's
internal matters.

1020
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:59,749
He clasped his hands
behind his back.

1021
00:32:00,333 --> 00:32:03,125
He was right that I
don't enjoy interfering.

1022
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:03,958
He paused.

1023
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,541
He was wrong
about what this is.

1024
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:08,374
Lucian's eyes moved
to the Royal Seer.

1025
00:32:08,791 --> 00:32:10,400
Something in his
face changed.

1026
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:11,333
Laurent said,

1027
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:12,541
nodding toward me.

1028
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:13,400
This woman,

1029
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:14,800
is my daughter-in-law.

1030
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:16,125
The contract was signed

1031
00:32:16,125 --> 00:32:17,541
and sealed three days ago.

1032
00:32:17,583 --> 00:32:18,958
He looked at Alpha Valeris,

1033
00:32:18,958 --> 00:32:20,541
who had appeared
in the doorway.

1034
00:32:20,541 --> 00:32:22,583
Your son kidnapped
her this morning.

1035
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:23,958
Held her against her will.

1036
00:32:24,374 --> 00:32:25,333
And just now attempted

1037
00:32:25,333 --> 00:32:26,791
to assault her in this room.

1038
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:29,125
He let that sit for a moment.

1039
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:30,749
I was outside the door.

1040
00:32:30,958 --> 00:32:31,800
I hear everything.

1041
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,749
The room was
completely silent.

1042
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,125
The Royal Seer was with me.

1043
00:32:37,333 --> 00:32:38,333
Laurent continued.

1044
00:32:38,791 --> 00:32:40,000
As a neutral witness.

1045
00:32:40,333 --> 00:32:41,800
At the Alpha King's request.

1046
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:44,333
Alpha Valeris
looked at Lucian.

1047
00:32:44,541 --> 00:32:45,400
Then at the Seer.

1048
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,333
Then back at Lucian.

1049
00:32:47,333 --> 00:32:48,541
Whatever calculation

1050
00:32:48,541 --> 00:32:50,749
he'd been running
died behind his eyes.

1051
00:32:50,800 --> 00:32:52,500
The Seer stepped forward.

1052
00:32:52,541 --> 00:32:53,400
I've seen enough,

1053
00:32:53,749 --> 00:32:54,583
he said simply.

1054
00:32:54,583 --> 00:32:56,800
I'll be reporting directly
to the Alpha King.

1055
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,166
Lucian turned to me,

1056
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:02,166
fast,

1057
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:02,958
desperate.

1058
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:03,500
Vivienne.

1059
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:05,400
He took one
step toward me.

1060
00:33:05,800 --> 00:33:07,500
Tell them it wasn't
what it looked like.

1061
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,000
Tell them you
came willingly.

1062
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:09,958
Just say that.

1063
00:33:10,374 --> 00:33:11,200
One sentence.

1064
00:33:11,200 --> 00:33:12,125
I looked at him.

1065
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,958
This man had poisoned me,

1066
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,500
Mutilated man my sister,

1067
00:33:15,600 --> 00:33:18,000
Spent three lifetimes
treating us like tools,

1068
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,200
and then discarding us

1069
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,800
when we stopped
being useful.

1070
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:23,200
And now he was asking
me for one more thing.

1071
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:26,541
Not a chance.

1072
00:33:28,749 --> 00:33:30,749
Laurent put his hand
out toward me.

1073
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,749
I took it and stood up.

1074
00:33:33,800 --> 00:33:36,500
Aria appeared at my
side immediately.

1075
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,374
She didn't say anything.

1076
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:40,000
We watched the
guards move in.

1077
00:33:40,600 --> 00:33:42,749
Luna Valeris sarted crying.

1078
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,800
Alpha Valeris
stood very still,

1079
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:46,000
with the expression of

1080
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:47,400
a man watching everything

1081
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:49,200
he built come
apart at the seams.

1082
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:52,000
Lucian didn't look away
from me until the guards

1083
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,500
put their hands on his arms.

1084
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:54,333
Even then,

1085
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:56,166
Even as they
walked him out,

1086
00:33:56,583 --> 00:33:57,800
He kept looking back.

1087
00:33:58,583 --> 00:34:00,200
The verdict came fast.

1088
00:34:00,583 --> 00:34:01,333
Lucian,

1089
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:03,333
eight years of exile in the

1090
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:04,600
Northern Wastelands.

1091
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,374
Soul-binding shackles.

1092
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:08,800
His inner wolf sealed
for the duration.

1093
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,958
Alpha Valeris
and Luna Valeris,

1094
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:12,600
five years for
aiding covering up,

1095
00:34:12,600 --> 00:34:13,800
and unlawful detention of

1096
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:15,400
a High Council
member's family.

1097
00:34:15,583 --> 00:34:16,800
Their pack title stripped.

1098
00:34:16,958 --> 00:34:18,500
The Blood Moon
Pack dissolved.

1099
00:34:18,749 --> 00:34:20,000
Valeris Manor seized,

1100
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:22,166
and transferred to High
Council jurisdiction.

1101
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:24,200
All of it done in
seventy two hours.

1102
00:34:24,200 --> 00:34:25,749
Aria found me in the garden

1103
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:27,374
the morning the
verdict was announced.

1104
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,749
She sat down beside me

1105
00:34:28,800 --> 00:34:30,749
without saying
anything for a while.

1106
00:34:34,600 --> 00:34:35,333
Then.

1107
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:36,541
Morgana.

1108
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:37,791
I looked up.

1109
00:34:39,600 --> 00:34:40,749
She's on the street.

1110
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:42,000
Packs gone.

1111
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,374
Manor's sealed.

1112
00:34:43,374 --> 00:34:45,000
She tried to go back to
the underground clubs,

1113
00:34:45,000 --> 00:34:46,374
but nobody will take her.

1114
00:34:46,374 --> 00:34:47,200
She paused.

1115
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:47,749
Vivienne,

1116
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:49,749
that painting got out.

1117
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,000
Everyone knows.

1118
00:34:52,600 --> 00:34:54,000
I didn't say anything.

1119
00:34:54,333 --> 00:34:55,374
Are you sorry for her?

1120
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:57,400
No.

1121
00:34:57,749 --> 00:34:59,200
I thought about it honestly.

1122
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:01,000
Morgana had known
what she was doing.

1123
00:35:01,125 --> 00:35:02,125
She'd let my
father's household

1124
00:35:02,200 --> 00:35:04,000
shelter her for six years

1125
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:04,958
while she maintained

1126
00:35:04,958 --> 00:35:06,374
a secret arrangement
with the man

1127
00:35:06,374 --> 00:35:07,400
who would later poison me

1128
00:35:07,500 --> 00:35:08,800
and mutilate my sister.

1129
00:35:09,125 --> 00:35:10,541
She hadn't warned anyone

1130
00:35:11,200 --> 00:35:12,500
She hadn't
chosen differently

1131
00:35:12,583 --> 00:35:13,749
when she had the chance.

1132
00:35:13,749 --> 00:35:15,200
Her consequences
were her own.

1133
00:35:15,200 --> 00:35:16,400
Neither am I.

1134
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:18,333
We sat there for a moment.

1135
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:20,200
Then Aria straightened up.

1136
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:23,600
Laurent brothers.

1137
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:25,000
Laurent brothers,

1138
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:25,749
I agreed.

1139
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:27,000
She smoothed her dress,

1140
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,000
failed completely.

1141
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:29,000
Luke said he's

1142
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,583
been interested
since I was six.

1143
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:32,000
Six, Vivian.

1144
00:35:32,600 --> 00:35:34,800
He's been waiting
fourteen years.

1145
00:35:34,958 --> 00:35:36,800
Lance told me he
watched me wait

1146
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:39,000
at the border post
for a whole month.

1147
00:35:39,749 --> 00:35:41,333
When Lucian
came back injured

1148
00:35:41,541 --> 00:35:43,400
and I wouldn't leave
until I knew he was okay.

1149
00:35:43,749 --> 00:35:44,400
I paused.

1150
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:46,125
He said that was
when he knew.

1151
00:35:46,200 --> 00:35:48,000
Aria looked at me sideways.

1152
00:35:48,200 --> 00:35:50,374
You waited a month at a
border post for Lucian?

1153
00:35:50,374 --> 00:35:51,374
I was seventeen.

1154
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:52,400
You were an idiot.

1155
00:35:52,600 --> 00:35:53,600
I was seventeen.

1156
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:54,333
I repeated.

1157
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,166
She almost smiled.

1158
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:59,333
The Laurent
brothers arrived at

1159
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:01,200
Coldwell Manor
that afternoon.

1160
00:36:02,749 --> 00:36:04,000
No ceremony,

1161
00:36:04,200 --> 00:36:05,400
No performance.

1162
00:36:07,500 --> 00:36:08,200
Just two men

1163
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:10,000
who knocked on the
front door and came in

1164
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,374
when my mother opened it.

1165
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:17,583
Lance found me
in the hallway.

1166
00:36:17,583 --> 00:36:18,800
He held out his hand.

1167
00:36:19,125 --> 00:36:21,400
I looked at it for a
second before I took it.

1168
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:22,800
His grip was steady.

1169
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,166
No Alpha aura,

1170
00:36:24,200 --> 00:36:25,200
No pressure.

1171
00:36:25,200 --> 00:36:26,500
Just a hand holding mine,

1172
00:36:26,500 --> 00:36:28,200
like it was something
he wanted to do,

1173
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:30,125
not something he
was entitled to.

1174
00:36:30,125 --> 00:36:32,125
My heart did
something unfamiliar.

1175
00:36:32,125 --> 00:36:33,000
Not the desperate,

1176
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:35,400
clinging feeling I used
to get around Lucian.

1177
00:36:35,541 --> 00:36:36,749
Something quieter.

1178
00:36:37,125 --> 00:36:38,541
Something that didn't hurt.

1179
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:39,583
You don't have to

1180
00:36:39,583 --> 00:36:41,000
figure everything out today

1181
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:42,541
I meant what I said.

1182
00:36:42,600 --> 00:36:43,583
I can wait.

1183
00:36:44,791 --> 00:36:45,400
I know.

1184
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:46,800
I didn't let go of his hand.

1185
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:49,000
From the sitting room
I heard Aria's voice,

1186
00:36:49,200 --> 00:36:50,400
bright and sharp.

1187
00:36:50,541 --> 00:36:51,800
Fourteen years?

1188
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:53,200
So you've been following me

1189
00:36:53,200 --> 00:36:54,541
around since I was six?

1190
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:56,600
That's actually kind
of weird, Luke.

1191
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:01,583
You were extremely
memorable.

1192
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:03,333
I was six.

1193
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,600
You challenged
three older kids

1194
00:37:06,600 --> 00:37:07,800
to a race and won.

1195
00:37:08,583 --> 00:37:09,500
I was impressed

1196
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,374
That's still weird.

1197
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:14,800
You keep saying that.

1198
00:37:15,600 --> 00:37:16,800
I looked at Lance.

1199
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:19,200
He was already smiling.

1200
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:21,200
I turned toward the
sitting room doorway.

1201
00:37:22,749 --> 00:37:23,200
Aria.

1202
00:37:23,600 --> 00:37:24,500
She looked at me.

1203
00:37:24,541 --> 00:37:25,000
Deal.

1204
00:37:25,374 --> 00:37:26,583
But this time,

1205
00:37:26,583 --> 00:37:27,583
we both win.

1206
00:37:27,583 --> 00:37:29,000
She stared at
me for a second.

1207
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:30,600
Then something
crossed her face,

1208
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:32,200
Soft and real,

1209
00:37:32,200 --> 00:37:33,600
under all the sharp edges.

1210
00:37:33,600 --> 00:37:34,958
She grabbed Luke's arm

1211
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,166
and turned back
to the window,

1212
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:37,333
like she hadn't heard me.

1213
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:38,583
But she was smiling

